  "body": "**Link to problem area**: Seems like this type is defined twice and should be de-duplicated. Both in the same file, first occurrence [here](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/blob/95d850c418ee544a25ee33c19c8fd65deedbf868/data/api/client-server/pusher.yaml#L107-L124).\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\n\r\nThe `PusherData` definition doesn't mention the `default_payload` field which is apparently has to be set for notification to work *at all* on iOS: https://github.com/matrix-org/sygnal/blob/main/docs/applications.md#ios-applications-beware",
